```jsx
import React from 'react';
import Layout from './Layout';

const App = () => {
  return (
    <Layout variant="centered">
      <h1>Hello World!</h1>
    </Layout>
  );
};
```

This way, you can easily switch between the two variants of the layout component. Note that you can also add more variants by adding more classes to the `layout` class in the CSS file. For example, you could add a `narrow` variant by adding the `max-w-sm` class:
